  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Oh Sa-Rang, a FM high school student who is so principled that he is called a walking moral textbook. He has a special secret, and that is... \"I only hear kind words\"! On the other hand, other people's bad words or swear words are just noise to him. Sa-Rang, who has been living in a world full of noise, meets 'Lina', a girl with a pure and clear voice one day. Sa-Rang feels excitement for the first time in her life and follows her to the broadcasting club... but turns out she's a swearer?! So-Ri Na is a surprising girl who \"translates bad words to people and hears them as kind words.\" However, for some reason, it doesn't work on Sa-rang. A two-way communication romance between 'Sa-Rang', who has heard swearing vividly for the first time in her life, and the sweariest girl in the school, 'Lina'!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
